---
// apps/frontend/site/src/lib/components/sections/features.astro
---

<section id="features" class="border-b border-border/70">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <span class="eyebrow">The vision</span>
      <h2 class="mt-5 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight">
        An RPG where every character truly lives.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Inspired by Baldur&apos;s Gate and Divinity, Aikami creates a rich, immersive world where
        NPCs have their own beliefs, personalities, and strategies. They interact with the player
        and the world based on these attributes &mdash; not a script.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ol
      class="mt-14 grid gap-px bg-border border border-border rounded-sm overflow-hidden md:grid-cols-2"
    >
      <li class="bg-card p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <span class="font-serif text-5xl leading-none text-brand">01</span>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight">Relationship-Driven</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Steal from your healer and they&apos;ll be less inclined to heal you. Smooth-talk a
              trader and get a discount. Every NPC remembers how you treat them.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-card p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <span class="font-serif text-5xl leading-none text-brand">02</span>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight">Dynamic Ally System</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Any NPC can become your ally &mdash; and may leave you if they no longer like you. If
              an NPC idolizes you, they might sacrifice themselves for your safety.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-card p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <span class="font-serif text-5xl leading-none text-brand">03</span>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight">Fear and Bravery</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Scared NPCs stay at the back during fights. Train them, and they become braver over
              time. Emotional depth drives combat and social dynamics.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-card p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
          <span class="font-serif text-5xl leading-none text-brand">04</span>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight">AI-Generated Lore</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              The game generates its lore dynamically. Historical events, myths, and legends are
              created by the AI, providing a unique backstory every time you play.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
